type":"object","required":["type","id","upperSpace","lowerSpace","openings","portals","geometryOwners"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"type":{"type":"string","const":"link"},"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"upperSpace":{"$ref":"#/$defs/recordRef"},"lowerSpace":{"$ref":"#/$defs/recordRef"},"openings":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/recordRef"},"maxItems":32768},"portals":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/recordRef"},"maxItems":32768},"geometryOwners":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/recordRef"},"maxItems":32768}}},{"type":"object","required":["type","id","kind","parent","aliasOf","domainTags","walls","portals","links"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"type":{"type":"string","const":"space"},"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"kind":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":1},"parent":{"type":["object","null"],"required":["id","anchor"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"anchor":{"$ref":"#/$defs/patchKey"}}},"aliasOf":{"type":["object","null"],"required":["id","anchor"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"anchor":{"$ref":"#/$defs/patchKey"}}},"domainTags":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string","minLength":1},"maxItems":349525},"walls":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","required":["record","side"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"record":{"$ref":"#/$defs/recordRef"},"side":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":1}}},"maxItems":26214},"portals":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object","required":["record","side"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"record":{"$ref":"#/$defs/recordRef"},"side":{"type":"integer","minimum":0,"maximum":1}}},"maxItems":26214},"links":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/recordRef"},"maxItems":32768}}},{"type":"object","required":["type","id","space","lattice","slotCells","lower","upper"],"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"type":{"type":"string","const":"footp